SELECT 'photography-content','Photography & Content','Reviewed workshop photography and content capability for documenting products, projects, process evidence and approved public storytelling where the exact setup and publication boundary are reviewed.','Product and project photography, workshop process documentation, before/after evidence, approved gallery assets and content capture that supports existing reviewed publication workflows.','Project-specific cameras, lighting, backgrounds, supports and approved media assets when the actual setup and intended use are documented.','Camera bodies, lenses, lighting output, colour accuracy, backdrop dimensions, capture settings, editing limits and publication suitability are not generalized in this profile. Each assignment remains evidence- and approval-dependent.','unmeasured','not_applicable','case_by_case','["photography-content"]','workshop','/custom-request/','Build 207 canonical photography-content process plus reviewed Workshop Journal, Gallery and content-publication boundaries. Exact technical settings and publication rights remain evidence-dependent.','reviewed',1
